@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #235573
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EAF4F8
title SaigonBite - Overall Order State Machine (Proposed)\nVõ Tấn Tài - 524H0126

state PaymentChoice <<choice>>
[*] --> PaymentChoice : placeOrder / UC03 (proposed)
PaymentChoice --> Pending : [COD]
PaymentChoice --> AwaitingPayment : [online]
AwaitingPayment --> Pending : verifiedPayment / supporting flow (proposed)
AwaitingPayment --> Cancelled : expire / supporting flow (proposed)
Pending --> Confirmed : confirmOrder / UC07\n[authorized Kitchen Staff]
Pending --> Rejected : rejectOrder / UC07\n[authorized Kitchen Staff and reason]
Pending --> Cancelled : cancelOrder / UC05\n[eligibility To Confirm]
Confirmed --> Preparing : startPreparation / UC08
Preparing --> Ready : markReady / UC08
Ready --> OutForDelivery : confirmPickup / UC10\n[assigned Shipper]
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : confirmDelivery / UC10\n[assigned Shipper and payment input valid]\n/ record COD if applicable
OutForDelivery --> Failed : reportFailure / UC10\n[assigned Shipper and reason]
Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Delivered --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Pending
  Pending corresponds provisionally to Khang's
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION. Khang's UC03/UC04 drafts
  are on a separate branch, not integrated here.
end note
note right of AwaitingPayment
  Proposed from Khang's UC03 draft.
  Payment verification and slot expiry policy
  remain outside the six-UC baseline.
end note
note right of Ready
  UC08 is outside this six-UC review but bridges
  UC07 confirmation and UC10 pickup.
end note
note bottom of OutForDelivery
  UC04 tracks Order without changing state.
  UC13 changes Hub data; UC16 reads report data.
  Khang's ACCEPTED / READY_FOR_PICKUP /
  DELIVERY_FAILED names differ from Thành's
  Confirmed / Ready / Failed. Rejection also
  differs: CANCELLED versus Rejected.
  Team/client reconciliation is required.
end note
footer AI-assisted draft; student review required before submission
@enduml
